# ==============================================================================
# AGRIOPS PLATFORM - CONSOLIDATED ROOT GITIGNORE (COMPONENTS 1, 2, 3 & 4)
# Unified Ignore Rules for:
#   - Component 1: Farm & Crop Management + Agent 1: Farm Planning Agent (FastAPI / LangGraph)
#   - Component 2: Autonomous Tasks & Evidence + Agent 2: Crop Doctor Agent (FastAPI / LangGraph / Chroma)
#   - Component 3: Inventory & Supply Chain + Agent 3: Inventory Reorder Agent (FastAPI / LangGraph)
#   - Component 4: Analytics, Production & RBAC + Agent 4: Safety Sentinel Agent (FastAPI / LangGraph)
#   - Backend Core: ASP.NET Core / .NET 10 / EF Core / PostgreSQL 17
#   - Frontend Web: React 18 / Vite / Tailwind CSS / Redux Toolkit
#   - Mobile Client: Flutter / Dart / Android / iOS
# ==============================================================================

